eturned it. The session corrected the document in place, re-checked every code quote and line reference, and added a dated correction to its report.\n\n**Its requests, answered.**\n1. **The AT11 native platform matrix, and the AT13 full fault matrix:** carried. Both stay operator rows, with no change.\n2. **F17-01 (pure `stale_generation` not exercised):** carried with wire-nodes and agent-core, with no change.\n- **Next:** handover 37 records this PR in its cut.\n"
